 chú mèo dễ thương. Bé có thể tự sáng tạo những câu chuyện thú vị, qua đó học được các kỹ năng cần thiết như xử lý tình huống hoặc sáng tạo cho bản thân\u003cbr /\u003e• Kích thước – Bộ lắp ráp bao gồm 58 mảnh ghép, sau khi hoàn thiện có chiều cao trên 2,5 inch (6 cm), rộng 2,5 inch (6,5 cm) và sâu 2,5 inch (6,5 cm)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/43/2d/fe/0ee5fc1f259f99a88b7e3fa48e9d9df9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ac/da/5f/c9f4a127f7c919cb3a55d7918b3af4d0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/09/c0/16/5235f249655bb4917dc63095cbbaa56d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/97/2b/99/3ba4537a58b9362a3edede8c93e64536.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/2a/2a/a3/42e2a446b3dcd36f029c3c26e2b5b0d4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/c6/a9/cf/60dbed760988f017764e75060086c94d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ac/e2/70/e307c749e483fab2e112f6e34c3b68a9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/55/cd/06/571de5cb4235318d64994275b6f1f939.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/19/e7/c1/49ff14945c4bd2c10bfe12a2ae4aaf44.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u0